      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0;">
          CitySphere<br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@citysphere.example">hello@citysphere.example</a><br />
          Egypt
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="credit">
      Prepared by the NEBU project team — <strong>Eslam Tarek Nabawy</strong>,
      <strong>Mohammed Tarek Omran</strong>, <strong>Nada Ahmed Samir</strong>, and
      <strong>Rahma Tarek</strong> — under the supervision of <strong>Dr. Ghada</strong>.
